             :rationale "String bound; ui_ast.options carries the nanopb counterpart."}
  "min_len" {:disposition :enforced-elsewhere
             :by "the `host proxy with empty proxy_id` refusal in the proxy finalizer"
             :rationale "An empty id is refused at load, loudly, by a clause that exists because the id is the host-side join key rather than because min_len declared it."
             :harm "None for the empty case. The residue is that the clause tests emptiness only, so it upholds min_len:1 exactly and would uphold nothing if the bound moved."}}

