         :test "target_overlay_border_width_past_the_declared_bound_is_refused"
         :rationale "Closed because the value is handed to LV_DPX, whose `(dpi * n + 80) / 160` is int32 arithmetic — so a large one overflows the multiply, which is undefined behaviour rather than a wide stroke. Its sibling bound on this same message, the box count, was already enforced; a reader of the proto could not tell the two apart."}}

