                  :rationale "Closed because the creation switch's default arm builds a bare container, which is ALSO what WIDGET_OBJ builds — so an undefined type rendered as an empty box indistinguishable from one an author wrote. The props half of the same node already refused an unknown arm for exactly that reason; the type half did not."}}}
